Netlify does not use customer data for AI training.

Hi Patrio Gabriel,

To support Netlify's evolution from a front-end deployment and hosting site=
 to a platform where anyone can prompt and build, Netlify is updating its P=
rivacy Statement to ensure our terms are as clear as possible.

At Netlify, you own your content. We do not sell your code or content, and =
we do not use it to train AI models without your permission. Netlify uses S=
ervice Data (non-identifying data) to operate and improve the platform. You=
r customer content is used only to provide our services to you.

We=E2=80=99re sending out this notification to remove any ambiguity and ref=
lect how we have always operated.

